#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:68
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This manual explains how to install and use &knetworkconf;, a module for "
"&kcontrolcenter; that enables management of Network Interfaces, Routing and "
"DNS properties."
msgstr ""

